{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14742","headline":"送陕府王司法 · 卢纶","name":"送陕府王司法","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东门雪覆尘，出送陕城人。\n粉郭朝喧市，朱桥夜掩津。\n上寮应重学，小吏已甘贫。\n谢朓曾爲掾，希君一比邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}